  <item>
    <title>58.学校没有教过的社会规则全靠自学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fada46e62b3c835c1d64a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fada46e62b3c835c1d64a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 做人不能太软弱、太老实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 不用时时都对人保持礼貌，无需为花钱购买服务的人提供情绪价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 无需过度解释自己，也可以不回答</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 拒绝别人时不一定要给理由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 切勿交浅言深</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> 不用太为别人的情绪负责</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 有的规则可以变通，有的规则也不一定合理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 还是要自己积累一些生活常识、法律知识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> 光做事不行还是需要让人看到</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期陪伴】</span></p><p><span>@辣味桃子</span></p><p><span>@一只烧麦</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
